   "file_text": "# Revisiting Glacial Melt\n# version: Version of Record, Studies in Computational Pragmatics (2024)\nentity,estimated_capacity\nB-04,3.7\nR-31,3.1\nN-26,3.2\nL-08,5.7\nM-09,3.1\n",
